  "name": "Quicken Catalyst",
  "type": "feat",
  "effects": [],
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<div><p style=\"border:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid black .75pt;padding:0in;mso-padding-alt:0in 0in 1.0pt 0in\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Trigger </strong>You are about to cast a spell that has a cast time of 2 or 3 actions that is at least 2 ranks lower than your highest-rank spell slot.</p><p style=\"border:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid black .75pt;padding:0in;mso-padding-alt:0in 0in 1.0pt 0in\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Frequency</strong> Once per day</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Requirements </strong>You have not used the Quickened Casting spellshape or similar feat this day.You can make sure that your work is delivered on time with the help of a catalyst. Your catalyzed spell is cast with 1 fewer actions (minimum 1).</p><hr></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Visionary Catalyst</strong> Your catalyst can apply to even the strongest of your spells. You can use Quicken Catalyst on any rank spell you know.</p>"
